    "cannot_support": [
      "A single training seed and 20 E episodes do not establish robustness across seeds, unseen demonstrations, N2/N10/N20, locked tests, or visual-policy generalization.",
      "The offline 5-cm proximity and recorded progress summaries are descriptive and cannot diagnose finger contact, slippage, reachability, collision causality, or an optimal recovery action. No failure-case frames are included.",
      "P1 changes both relation conditioning and action coordinates, so this packet does not isolate which part of that combined representation causes its advantage. P1/P3 equality in success count does not prove auxiliary learning useless in every setting.",
      "Lower training loss cannot establish generalization or causal mechanism, and total losses with auxiliary channels are not directly comparable to action-only totals.",
      "The evidence does not select a principled new frame, contact-phase threshold, loss weight, learned router, or late-stage controller; adding one now would rely on an unverified mechanism. Fixed robot/gripper/table geometry limits assumptions of whole-scene rotational symmetry."
    ],
